{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39945","headline":"塔院小屋四壁皆是卿相题名因成四韵 · 徐夤","name":"塔院小屋四壁皆是卿相题名因成四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雁塔搀空映九衢，每看华宇每踟蹰。\n题名尽是台衡迹，满壁堪爲宰辅图。\n鸾凤岂巢荆棘树，虬龙多蛰帝王都。\n谁知远客思归梦，夜夜无船自过湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39945.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39945","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}